SUMMARY:Forbidden Kiss LIVE - Tropicana!
DESCRIPTION:It’s Tropicana Time at Forbidden Kiss LIVE! Put on your party clothes!\nJoin Cheryl King and her guests for this exotic and exciting vaudeville review!\nWith magic from Vixen\, the Forbidden Magician\, burlesque from Thotty McNaughty\, Montana Skye\, and Linda Lindo. Faethora and Mimic Velour bring musical acts\, and Kat Motley is working up another of her fantastic costume routines. Comedy from Cheryl King and Improv from Underground Improv finish off this extravaganza of hot and steamy showpieces.\nAudience members will be invited to give prompts for the improv sketches\, and prizes will be awarded for best prompts.\nPURCHASE IN ADVANCE AND SAVE! PLUS RESERVE A TABLE WITH OUR ZONE TICKET OPTION\nReserved seating in Zone A $27\, Zone B $22\, Zone C $17 (does not guarantee seating) Tickets at the door $27 (seating not guaranteed).\nDoors open 6:30pm. Show starts promptly at 7:30pm.\nAdult material. 18+\nOur kitchen serves our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermission. (Kitchen available only at events with 60 or more advance tickets sold)
