SUMMARY:STRANGELOVE at the Mystic Theatre
DESCRIPTION:STRANGELOVE – The Depeche Mode Experience with Temptation-tribute to New Order/Joy Division \n  \nStrangelove-The DEPECHE MODE Experience Hailing from points across USA\, Strangelove-The DEPECHE MODE Experience deliver a career spanning\, pitch perfect “best of” concert that transports listeners through time and touches on several key points in Depeche Mode’s 45+ year career. Songs from throughout the Depeche canon of 50+ chart-topping hits are lovingly recreated\, with the look and feel of a classic-era DM arena show. No detail of STRANGELOVE’s presentation has been overlooked; and stage set pieces and in-show costume changes reflect different eras of Depeche Mode’s story. \n“They do it to such fine detail it’s scary” (Martin Gore-Depeche Mode) \nSTRANGELOVE ONLINE: https://www.depechetribute.com/ \nTemptation-tribute to New Order/Joy Division \nFronted by Night Crickets [David J (Love & Rockets/Bauhaus) / Victor DeLorenzo (Violent Femmes)] and solo musician- Darwin Meiners on lead vocals and guitar\, Temptation present the most authentic and spirited tribute to New Order and Joy Division this side of Manchester. Their “Peter Hook\, “Pinky”\, is even from Manchester! All the hits from both New Order and Joy Division are delivered with authenticity and brio! \nhttps://www.instagram.com/temptationneworder/ \n  \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/strangelove-at-the-mystic-theatre/
